      <guid>https://loessl.org/posts/ios-localization-with-ilocalize/</guid>
      <description>I did it once before and now I have to do it again - and of course, I forgot how to do it. This time I&amp;rsquo;ll write it down how on way of localisation of an iOS project works.
I don&amp;rsquo;t use nib files and all user facing strings are set in code with NSLocalizedStrings(&amp;hellip;). If you are using nibs or need to translate strings in Storyboard and/or nib files, your approach might differ.</description>
